<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Laserbeam - (built 1974) 26,637 dwt sold to Syrian buyers for $2.3 million.</p>
<p>Rio Ciervos - (built 1974) 26,602 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $1.45 million.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION - Kookaburra - (built 1972) 69,889 dwt sold to India for $166 per ldt.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
